tive experience']::text[],ARRAY['Beginner''s guide to choosing between pointed pen and brush pen calligraphy','How to address wedding envelopes like a professional calligrapher','The history and evolution of Copperplate and Spencerian scripts in America','Best inks and papers for calligraphy beginners: a practitioner''s buying guide','How to set up an ergonomic calligraphy workspace at home','Corporate event ideas: why calligraphy workshops boost team creativity','Caring for and cleaning calligraphy nibs to extend their lifespan']::text[],'["International Association of Master Penmen, Engrossers and Teachers of Penmanship (IAMPETH) membership or workshop completion", "Certificates from recognized calligraphy guilds such as the Society of Scribes or a regional lettering arts society", "Publication of calligraphy work in industry books, magazines (e.g., Letter Arts Review), or editorial wedding media", "Years of verified teaching experience with documented student outcomes or testimonials", "Partnership or sponsorship recognition from premium ink and pen brands (e.g., Speedball, Pilot Parallel, Winsor & Newton)", "Featured instructor status on established online learning platforms (e.g., Skillshare, Creativebug)"]'::jsonb,'{"profile_completeness": 0.2, "review_volume": 0.2, "listing_coverage": 0.15, "content_freshness": 0.15, "schema_completeness": 0.15, "ai_visibility": 0.15}'::jsonb,100,false),
