.)", "Residency Training: Completion of accredited medical residency programs", "Fellowship Status: Additional subspecialty training (Cardiology, Endocrinology, etc.)", "Medical School Pedigree: Graduation from ACGME-accredited institutions", "Continuing Medical Education (CME): Active participation in ongoing professional development", "Hospital Privileges: Admitting privileges at accredited hospitals and health systems"]'::jsonb,'{"profile_completeness": 0.2, "review_volume": 0.2, "listing_coverage": 0.15, "content_freshness": 0.15, "schema_completeness": 0.15, "ai_visibility": 0.15}'::jsonb,100,false),
